cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "evidence-gate: a referee for the generation layer"
abstract: "The EDA skeleton (search / prove / perturb / cover) pointed at predictive claims, with reproducible perturbations instead of wet-lab oracles: label permutation as a negative control, split by molecule / document / year / assay. One model and one pipeline pass on EGFR and are rejected on hERG (post-2000 AUC 0.453)."
authors:
